<document xmlns="http://cnx.rice.edu/cnxml" xmlns:m="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML">
  <title>8.8.5: Practice</title>
  <metadata xmlns:md="http://cnx.rice.edu/mdml">
    <md:content-id>m02221</md:content-id>
    <md:title>8.8.5: Practice</md:title>
    <md:uuid>7c0720ed-bc8e-4f3b-b1e2-54fd9ecf8540</md:uuid>
  </metadata>
  <content>
  <section><para>Complete the following questions to practice the skills you have learned in this lesson.</para>
<section><exercise id="d7a25650-5023-4902-8bb2-fe8c31fd3f77" class="multiple-choice"><problem><para>Which of the following is equivalent to \(10^2−12^2\)?</para>
      <para>Multiple Choice:</para><para>\((10 + 12)(10 + 12)\)</para><para>\((10 − 12)(10 − 12)\)</para><para>\((10 −12)^2\)</para><para>\((10 + 12)(10 − 12)\)</para></problem><solution><para>Try again. Revisit activity 8.8.2.
     </para><para>The correct answer is \((10 + 12)(10 − 12)\).
     </para></solution></exercise><exercise id="aac94111-04f1-44af-9af6-8aef68283fc6" class="multiple-choice"><problem><para>For questions 2 – 10, select the expression in factored form.</para><para>\(c^2 − 25\)</para>
      <para>Multiple Choice:</para><para>\(c(c − 25)\)</para><para>\((c − 5)(c − 5)\)</para><para>\((c − 5)(c + 5)\)</para><para>\((c + 5)(c + 5)\)</para></problem><solution><para>Try again. Revisit activities 8.8.3 and 8.8.4.</para><para>The correct answer is \((c − 5)(c + 5)\).
     </para></solution></exercise><exercise id="_9925a0b8-063f-406f-a75e-d47e26f45973" class="multiple-choice"><problem><para>\(9w^2 − 121\)</para>
      <para>Multiple Choice:</para><para>\((3w − 11)(3w + 11)\)</para><para>\((3w + 11)(3w + 11)\)</para><para>\(w(9w − 121)\)</para><para>\((3w − 11)(3w − 11)\)</para></problem><solution><para>Try again. Revisit activities 8.8.3 and 8.8.4.</para><para>The correct answer is \((3w − 11)(3w + 11)\).
     </para></solution></exercise><exercise id="_6a884aa4-cbec-401d-9647-48e7c6767f0b" class="multiple-choice"><problem><para>\(h^2− 121\)</para>
      <para>Multiple Choice:</para><para>\((h − 11)^2\)</para><para>\((h − 11)(h + 11)\)</para><para>\((h − 11)(h − 11)\)</para><para>\((h + 11)(h + 11)\)</para></problem><solution><para>Try again. Revisit activities 8.8.3 and 8.8.4.</para><para>The correct answer is \((h − 11)(h + 11)\).
     </para></solution></exercise><exercise id="_5400c334-9ae8-4faa-a538-6dc044a84639" class="multiple-choice"><problem><para>\(64 − d^2\)</para>
      <para>Multiple Choice:</para><para>\((8 − d)(8 − d)\)</para><para>\((8 − d)(8 + d)\)</para><para>\((8 + d)(8 + d)\)</para><para>Not possible</para></problem><solution><para>Try again. Revisit activities 8.8.3 and 8.8.4.</para><para>The correct answer is \((8 − d)(8 + d)\).
     </para></solution></exercise><exercise id="de43ec38-7772-41d6-9788-61b46765e0f4" class="multiple-choice"><problem><para>\(4b^2 − 25\)</para>
      <para>Multiple Choice:</para><para>\((2b − 5)(2b + 5)\)</para><para>\((2b − 5)(2b − 5)\)</para><para>\(b(4b − 25)\)</para><para>\((2b + 5)(2b + 5)\)</para></problem><solution><para>Try again. Revisit activities 8.8.3 and 8.8.4.
     </para><para>The correct answer is \((2b − 5)(2b + 5)\).</para></solution></exercise><exercise id="da77c4e9-72ff-4cc7-ae59-c20b52b1bcb9" class="multiple-choice"><problem><para>\(49 − 81z^2\)</para>
      <para>Multiple Choice:</para><para>\((7 + 9z)(7 + 9z)\)</para><para>\((7 − 9z)(7 − 9z)\)</para><para>\(z(49 − 81z)\)</para><para>\((7 − 9z)(7 + 9z)\)</para></problem><solution><para>Try again. Revisit activities 8.8.3 and 8.8.4.</para><para>The correct answer is \((7 − 9z)(7 + 9z)\).</para></solution></exercise><exercise id="_8bf666ff-4590-429f-8a7d-3c52568e0e4b" class="multiple-choice"><problem><para>\(100y^2−4\)</para>
      <para>Multiple Choice:</para><para>\((10y + 2)(10y + 2)\)</para><para>\((10y − 2)(10y + 2)\)</para><para>\((10y − 2)(10y − 2)\)</para><para>Not possible</para></problem><solution><para>Try again. Revisit activities 8.8.3 and 8.8.4.</para><para>The correct answer is \((10y − 2)(10y + 2)\).
     </para></solution></exercise><exercise id="e72b9f84-b78b-4b93-9c08-a12b8f3e90ef" class="multiple-choice"><problem><para>\(x^2+9\)</para>
      <para>Multiple Choice:</para><para>\((x − 3)(x − 3)\)</para><para>\((x − 3)(x + 3)\)</para><para>\((x + 3)(x + 3)\)</para><para>Not possible</para></problem><solution><para>Try again. Revisit activities 8.8.3 and 8.8.4.</para><para>The correct answer is not possible.</para></solution></exercise><exercise id="_2b766e16-3681-4ed9-bb2b-287040d57da8" class="multiple-choice"><problem><para>\(144 − 16g^2\)</para>
      <para>Multiple Choice:</para><para>\((12 − 4g)(12 + 4g)\)</para><para>\((12 + 4g)(12 + 4g)\)</para><para>\((12 − 4g)(12 − 4g)\)</para><para>Not possible</para></problem><solution><para>Try again. Revisit activities 8.8.3 and 8.8.4.</para><para>The correct answer is \((12 − 4g)(12 + 4g)\).
     </para></solution></exercise></section></section>
</content>
